.TH SDL_EventAction 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_EventAction \- The type of action to request from
.BR SDL_PeepEvents ().

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_events.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef enum SDL_EventAction
.BI "{
.BI "    SDL_ADDEVENT,  /**< Add events to the back of the queue. */
.BI "    SDL_PEEKEVENT, /**< Check but don't remove events from the queue front. */
.BI "    SDL_GETEVENT   /**< Retrieve/remove events from the front of the queue. */
.BI "} SDL_EventAction;
.fi
.SH AVAILABILITY
This enum is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

